                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today, I joined with 9/11 survivors and responders to reintroduce the 9/11 Responder and Survivor Health Funding Correction Act. This bill would ensure the @WTCHealthPrgm has the resources needed to care for those suffering from 9/11-related conditions.\n\nI thank my House and Senate co-leads and our 9/11 advocates, responders, and survivors who have fought tirelessly for this program. We made a promise to never forget. Today, we stood together to reaffirm our commitment to delivering on that promise.",
